#: ../../development.md:31 a4e4f230c6974a8592a77c31c379e1fe
msgid "函数与类 docstring"
msgstr "Function and class docstrings"

#: ../../development.md:33 f71b01a22ec64696ae61cb2305dcb380
msgid ""
"公共函数、公共类和 dataclass 使用单行摘要 + `Args` / `Returns` / `Raises` 的 Google-style"
" 格式。不要在 `Args` 中重复 type hint，只写含义、单位和约束。"
msgstr "Public functions, public classes and dataclasses use a one-line summary plus the Google-style `Args` / `Returns` / `Raises` sections. Do not repeat type hints in `Args`; write only the meaning, units and constraints."

#: ../../development.md:51 b97e7b526d3d4ceea0dd08e0da439612
msgid ""
"`main()` 和 `parse_args()` 也需要 docstring：`parse_args()` "
"说明返回解析后的命名空间；`main()` 说明执行完整脚本流程且通常不返回值。私有 helper 可以使用较短 "
"docstring，但仍应说明单位、边界或失败条件。"
msgstr "`main()` and `parse_args()` also need docstrings: `parse_args()` states that it returns the parsed namespace; `main()` states that it executes the full script flow and usually returns nothing. Private helpers may use shorter docstrings but should still state units, bounds or failure conditions."

#: ../../development.md:53 2848938372fd440e95136fa52b9067ec
msgid "CLI help 文本（工具脚本）"
msgstr "CLI help text (tool scripts)"

#: ../../development.md:55 07a86e26a5364181944ba3ddeab902fe
msgid ""
"`scripts/` 下的独立工具脚本（`download_kernels.py`、`smoke_mcp_serve.py`） 使用 "
"`argparse`。help 文本必须回答三个问题：参数控制什么、默认值是什么、单位是什么。示例："
msgstr "The standalone tool scripts under `scripts/` (`download_kernels.py`, `smoke_mcp_serve.py`) use `argparse`. Help text must answer three questions: what the argument controls, what the default is, and what the unit is. Example:"

#: ../../development.md:67 b821842b5495479ebf5a21aeabb64bcf
msgid "无量纲 CR3BP 参数应注明为无量纲；角度单位写 rad 或度；时间单位写 TU、天或秒。布尔开关说明开启后的行为。"
msgstr "Dimensionless CR3BP parameters must be marked as dimensionless; angles are stated in rad or degrees; time units as TU, days or seconds. Boolean switches describe what enabling them does."

#: ../../development.md:69 9a9ea8cd413a43dbb4df6ecee9a363b2
msgid "国际化"
msgstr "Internationalization"

#: ../../development.md:71 6c498808e5014ef38dbaa4f5b63f4ea8
msgid ""
"界面 i18n 在前端 `frontend/src/i18n.ts`：中英两份字符串字典，`t(key)` 取用， 语言选择存 "
"localStorage、重启保留。新增界面文本时同步向两个字典各加一条键值； 新增语种则追加一份字典。（PyQt 时代的 "
"`tools/update_i18n.py` 与 `src/app/i18n/` 已随旧 UI 删除。）"
msgstr "UI i18n lives in the frontend `frontend/src/i18n.ts`: two string dictionaries (Chinese and English) fetched via `t(key)`, with the language choice stored in localStorage and kept across restarts. When adding UI copy, add one entry to each dictionary; a new language appends another dictionary. (The PyQt-era `tools/update_i18n.py` and `src/app/i18n/` were deleted with the old UI.)"

#: ../../development.md:76 c45985372fad45689f71b73d0e1f6b25
msgid "Sphinx 文档"
msgstr "Sphinx Documentation"

#: ../../development.md:78 eb7804624fea4746b81c52c084b745a6
msgid "Sphinx 源文件位于 `docs/source/`，叙事文档通过 MyST Markdown 接入。"
msgstr "Sphinx sources live in `docs/source/`, with narrative documents included through MyST Markdown."

#: ../../development.md:84 3de95827f685487aa9341aaa1ab11e79
msgid ""
"提交前应至少确认构建无 ERROR，并尽量清理 WARNING。若新增/删除叙事页面，请在 `docs/source/index.rst` 的对应"
" toctree 中增删条目，并同步更新英文 `.po`（见 `docs/README.md` 的 `sphinx-intl update` "
"流程）。"
msgstr "Before submitting, at minimum confirm the build has no ERRORs, and clean up WARNINGs where possible. When adding or removing narrative pages, add or remove the entry in the corresponding toctree of `docs/source/index.rst` and update the English `.po` accordingly (see the `sphinx-intl update` flow in `docs/README.md`)."

#: ../../development.md:86 590e89933af141e89dd32012b1b910f0
msgid "多语言 README"
msgstr "Multilingual README"

#: ../../development.md:88 594367c87267425c89664569f8852761
msgid "`README.md` 为中文主文档；其他语言版本命名为 `README.<lang>.md`（当前仅有 `README.en.md`）。"
msgstr "`README.md` is the Chinese master; other language versions are named `README.<lang>.md` (currently only `README.en.md`)."

#: ../../development.md:89 c84cb842179a4b2897cd47b77f3c5458
msgid "修改任一语言版本时，应在同一提交中同步其余版本，保持章节结构一一对应。"
msgstr "When modifying any language version, sync the others in the same commit, keeping section structures in one-to-one correspondence."

#: ../../development.md:90 80323067d4f846dea1ab5b120d1fdfea
msgid "代码块、命令、路径、模块名一律不翻译；标题翻译后需同步修正文内锚点链接。"
msgstr "Code blocks, commands, paths and module names are never translated; after translating a heading, fix in-text anchor links accordingly."

#: ../../development.md:91 bd3fe9bcfebc43318d5a64cea268c86b
msgid "各语言版本顶部均应放置语言切换链接。"
msgstr "Every language version carries a language-switch link at the top."

